straight, how many of them are there in total?\", \"Oh, I actually phoned the Sorir one earlier, so can you log that for me so I don't forget?\", \"And when did we last speak? I've honestly lost track.\", \"Different thing, I've got a new card and I'm rubbish at picking numbers, so can you invent a PIN for it?\"], [\"umm what's… what've I got in my calendar saturday?\", \"oh and, uh, who's in the hawes cove picture?\", \"wait, how many of them are there?\", \"ok so I phoned the, um, the Sorir one, can you log that?\", \"and uh… when did we last speak?\", \"hmm, oh, can you like make up a PIN for my new card?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0008\", \"v\": [[\"can u log that i had a call with Grindeth Postett today\"], [\"umm can you log that I, uh, had a call with Grindeth Postett today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0009\", \"v\": [[\"My car's making a weird noise again and I can never remember who I use, so which contact is my mechanic?\", \"Hang on, random one, I was scrolling through old pictures, so who's in the euphonium picture?\", \"Ok, back to the mechanic, can you pull up their contact details so I can get in touch?\", \"Different thing, my plans have shifted a bit, so can you move both the Cobohaven things, the task and the calendar entry, to sunday?\", \"Oh and Sorir wants to chip in on things, so can you put Sorir in the group?\", \"The capoeira one, but first can you show me its expenses so I know what's been spent?\"], [\"Could you tell me which of my contacts is my mechanic?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget: could you tell me who's in the euphonium picture?\", \"Thank you. Going back to my mechanic, could you give me their contact details, please?\", \"Also, would you mind moving both Cobohaven things, the task and the calendar entry, to sunday?\", \"Could you please put Sorir in the group?\", \"About the capoeira one, could you show me its expenses, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w38-0010\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in Hastings trip, please?\